flowchart LR
  O[Owner<br/>signs in with an email<br/>gets a wallet] -->|screenshot / chat / invoice| R[Reader<br/>Strands agent<br/>structured output]
  R --> D[Draft<br/>the owner reviews<br/>then starts]
  D --> C[Collector<br/>Strands agent<br/>list_obligations · send_message · ask_owner]
  C -->|streamed live| B[Board<br/>one-tap send<br/>copy · WhatsApp · email · text]
  B -->|one-time link| P[Payer]
  P <-->|asks, the agent answers| PAY[Pay page<br/>talk to the agent<br/>Privy embedded wallet]
  PAY -->|USDC transfer| ARC[(Arc)]
  ARC -->|receipt + Transfer log| S[Settler<br/>verifies · thanks · pays out]
  S --> RC[Receipt<br/>public, shareable]
  S -->|payout from the agent's<br/>Privy server wallet| O
  C -->|3 nudges, or “I paid cash”| DEC[Decision inbox<br/>settled · still owed · write off]
  DEC --> O
